-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span>Enhanced website performance and responsiveness through code optimization, leading to faster load times and an improved user experience, and also implemented dynamic social media content feeds to boost user engagement.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span>Implemented a real-time notification system for integration with external streaming software (OBS).</span></li></ul><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-white/5\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Next.js</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Node.js</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Express.js</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Socket.IO</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">SQL</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">TypeScript</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Tailwind CSS</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">REST API<