lns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v3\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 9h18\"></path></svg> <!-- -->July 2025 - August 2025</span></div><div class=\"text-base font-semibold text-neutral-300 mb-4\">7 Seers</div><ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-4 text-sm text-neutral-400\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span>Developed and deployed full-stack features, enhancing core application functionality from backend processing to frontend.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span>Integrated payment routing system enabling automated splits and payouts for a multi-vendor platform.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span>Enhanced website performance and responsiveness through code optimization.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span>Implemented dynamic social media content feeds to boost user engagement.</span></li></ul><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-white/5\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Next.js</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Node.js</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Express.js</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Socket.IO</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">SQL</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">TypeScript</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Tailwind CSS</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">REST API</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Graph API</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-14 md:pl-24 mb-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 md:left-4.75 top-6 w-10 h-10 bg-black border-2 border-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.3)] z-10 text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"></path><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><div class=\"group relative bg-neutral-900/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden hover:border-white/25 hover:shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.04)] p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-white/40 to-transparent transition-opacity duration-300 z-10 opacity-0\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-300 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(320px circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), transparent 65%)\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 \"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-heading font-bold text-white\">Full Stack Developer</h4><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-neutral-300 border border-white/10\">Part Time</span></div><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v3\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 9h18\"></path></svg> <!-- -->2024 - 2025</span></div><div class=\"text-base font-semibold text-neutral-300 mb-4\">MITMAAI - MIT Muzaffarpur Alumni Association International</div><ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-4 text-sm text-neutral-400\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span>Developed a dynamic and responsive alumni portal using Next.js for the frontend and PostgreSQL for data storage.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span>Built a role-based dashboard system with separate access for superadmin, admins and alumni.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span>Designed and integrated components for alumni registration, event management, and 3D Earth visualization showing animated markers for alumni locations around the globe.</span></li></ul><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-white/5\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Next.js</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">PostgreSQL</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">TypeScript</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">TailwindCSS</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Prisma</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Framer Motion</span></div></div></div></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-semibold ml-14 md:ml-24 mb-6 text-neutral-300\">Education</h3><div class=\"relative pl-14 md:pl-24 mb-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 md:left-4.75 top-6 w-10 h-10 bg-black border-2 border-white/80 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] z-10 text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"group relative bg-neutral-900/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden hover:border-white/25 hover:shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.04)] p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-white/40 to-transparent transition-opacity duration-300 z-10 opacity-0\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-300 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(320px circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), transparent 65%)\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 \"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-heading font-bold text-white\">B.Tech in Information Technology</h4><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v3\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 9h18\"></path></svg> <!-- -->2021 - 2025</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-base font-semibold text-neutral-300\">Muzaffarpur Institute of Technology, Muzaffarpur, Bihar</span><span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/10 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">CGPA: 8.25</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">Specialized in Computer Science &amp; Information Technology, Data Structures, Algorithms, Database Management, and Full Stack Development.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-14 md:pl-24 mb-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 md:left-4.75 top-6 w-10 h-10 bg-black border-2 border-white/80 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] z-10 text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"group relative bg-neutral-900/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden hover:border-white/25 hover:shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.04)] p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-white/40 to-transparent transition-opacity duration-300 z-10 opacity-0\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-300 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(320px circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), transparent 65%)\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 \"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-heading font-bold text-white\">Intermediate Science - PCM</h4><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v3\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 9h18\"></path></svg> <!-- -->2018 - 2020</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"text-base font-semibold text-neutral-300\">Lady Anusuya Singhania Educational Academy, Jhalawar, Rajasthan</span><span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-neutral-300 bg-white/10 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Percentage: 80.8%</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">Focus on Physics, Chemistry, and Advanced Mathematics.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"projects\" class=\"relative min-h-screen py-16 md:py-28 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center z-10 \"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 mb-16\"><div class=\"h-px grow bg-linear-to-l from-white/20 to-transparent\"></div><h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold whitespace-nowrap\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)\"><span class=\"text-gradient\">Projects</span></h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\"><div class=\"group relative bg-neutral-900/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden  p-0! flex flex-col h-full group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-white/40 to-transparent transition-opacity duration-300 z-10 opacity-0\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-300 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(320px circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), transparent 65%)\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 \"><div class=\"relative w-full h-60 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-900\"><img alt=\"S3 Bucket Manager\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover filter grayscale contrast-110 gro