k web platform enabling artists to showcase, sell, and manage their artwork with personalized user roles (Admin, Artist, General) and dynamic interfaces.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-mono tracking-wider\">Next.js</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-mono tracking-wider\">PostgreSQL</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-mono tracking-wider\">TypeScript</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-mono tracking-wider\">TailwindCSS</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-mono tracking-wider\">Prisma</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-neutral-300 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-mono tracking-wider\">Shadcn UI</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\"><div class=\"group relative bg-neutral-900/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden  p-0! flex flex-col h-full group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-white/40 to-transparent transition-opacity duration-300 z-10 opacity-0\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-300 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(320px circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), transparent 65%)\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 \"><div class=\"relative w-full h-60 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-900\"><img alt=\"DocHive: Collaborative Document Tool